PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E37A1

   1 a 0000 e37a1: procedure options(main);
   2 c 0006    declare p pointer, bp pointer, z fixed, y fixed, m fixed;
   3 c 0006    declare 1 s based(p), 2 a fixed, 2 nx pointer;
   4 c 0006    declare w based(bp) fixed;
   5 c 0006    allocate s set(p);
